OL,3,GNEWSARail disruption after body found
OL,4,Aon tracks
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services between Stevenage and
OL,7,FLondon have been disrupted after a
OL,8,Fperson was found dead on the tracks.
OL,10,FBritish Transport Police said
OL,11,Fparamedics were called to "a casualty
OL,12,Fon the tracks at Knebworth railway
OL,13,Fstation", but the person was pronounced
OL,14,Fdead at the scene.
OL,16,FGreat Northern Rail and Thameslink said
OL,17,Flines have now reopened between the
OL,18,Fstations, but added passengers should
OL,19,Fexpect trains to be cancelled, delayed
OL,20,Fby up to an hour, or diverted via
OL,21,FHertford North.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
